      "notes": "The conventional tetragonal unit-cell volume is a^2*c and contains Z=2 SiO2 formula units. Pressures were calculated from the paired Au volume and temperature using Tsuchiya (2003). The publisher lists tab-delimited supplements for Tables 1-4; Table 1 contains the primary observations, Table 2 the fitted parameters, and Tables 3-4 calculated P-V-T and thermoelastic-property grids.",
      "provenance": {
        "type": "transcribed_from_table",
